WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:05.453
Ringo sighed and patted Spark.

2
00:00:05.454 --> 00:00:14.852
Spark cried harder. "I'm sorry I took the rover.

3
00:00:14.853 --> 00:00:18.017
Can we go home now?"

4
00:00:18.018 --> 00:00:25.665
"No," Ringo said. "We have to finish this mission."

5
00:00:25.666 --> 00:00:30.826
Bot nodded. "Will you help us rescue Bud?"

6
00:00:30.827 --> 00:00:38.612
Spark wiped his tears. "I'll try."

7
00:00:38.613 --> 00:00:40.896
Ringo looked at Bot.

8
00:00:40.897 --> 00:00:47.280
"Can you find the drone's signal?"

9
00:00:47.281 --> 00:00:52.466
Shwoop! Bot's antenna stretched up.

10
00:00:52.467 --> 00:00:55.124
Bud appeared on Bot's screen.

11
00:00:55.125 --> 00:01:00.143
Moon sand came up to his chest.

12
00:01:00.144 --> 00:01:16.335
"We should hurry!" Bot said.

13
00:01:16.336 --> 00:01:20.585
Soon they found Bud.

14
00:01:20.586 --> 00:01:23.183
Sand was up to his neck.

15
00:01:23.184 --> 00:01:29.220
"Help!" he cried.

16
00:01:29.221 --> 00:01:32.667
"Grab this!" Spark threw him a rope.

17
00:01:32.668 --> 00:01:40.269
Bud grabbed it—but it snapped.

18
00:01:40.270 --> 00:01:44.183
He sank beneath the sand.

19
00:01:44.184 --> 00:01:50.876
Shwoop! Bot's arm shot into the sand.

20
00:01:50.877 --> 00:01:56.997
"Drive, Spark!" Ringo said. "Go slow!"

21
00:01:56.998 --> 00:02:01.342
Ringo held Bot tightly.

22
00:02:01.343 --> 00:02:05.039
Spark drove the rover.

23
00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:38.877
Bud slid out of the sand!

24
00:02:38.878 --> 00:02:43.411
"Ringo, you saved the day!" Lou said.

25
00:02:43.412 --> 00:02:48.064
Ringo smiled. "Spark helped."

26
00:02:48.065 --> 00:02:58.685
Bud nodded. "Thank you, everyone!"

27
00:02:58.686 --> 00:03:03.513
"Dad! I went on a real mission," Spark said.

28
00:03:03.514 --> 00:03:07.725
Commander Cosmo smiled. "That's great."

29
00:03:07.726 --> 00:03:12.977
Ringo grinned. "We have one more mission, Spark.

30
00:03:12.978 --> 00:03:22.828
Let's finish my model spaceship!"

